  "description": "ORABIW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C50 H72 Dy4 N14 O24 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),2(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.680-4.176 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.03-128.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C56H86Dy4N18O32.",
